OL,4,BEvans' gripes & unexpected departures  
OL,5,GThe Championship resumes this weekend  
OL,6,G- but not all will be as it was.       
OL,8,FBlackburn Rovers and Swansea City dip  
OL,9,Ftheir feet into life without Tony      
OL,10,FMowbray and Vitor Matos at their       
OL,11,Fsides, for very different reasons.     
OL,13,FMeanwhile, Bristol Rovers boss Steve   
OL,14,FEvans remains in charge in League Two  
OL,15,Fbut, given his comments after their    
OL,16,Flast game, it might not be a           
OL,17,Frelationship built to last.            
OL,19,FHere are five things to capture your   
OL,20,Fattention this EFL weekend.            
